#. <CLT 3>“人間関係”<CLT>…それが最初の殺人の時、
#. ボクらに提示された動機だったはずだ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The driving force behind the motive you presented us\n"
"with at that point was <CLT 3>human connections<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ピンポン、ピンポン。ご名答だよ。
#. あの時、アタシが配ったＤＶＤには…
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Ding ding ding! You got it. Remember those DVDs I gave\n"
"you guys?"
msgstr ""

#. みなさんの大切な人間関係を台無しにした映像が
#. 映ってたんだよね…
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Each video showed the total destruction of your most\n"
"important relationships."
msgstr ""

#. 例えば、家族だったり…
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "For example, your family..."
msgstr ""

#. 例えば、友人だったりさ…
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "For example, your friends..."
msgstr ""

#. それらを破壊し、そして見せ付ける事で…
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I ruined all those relationships, and showed you the\n"
"results."
msgstr ""

#. みなさんの『ここから出たい』という気持ちを煽り、
#. コロシアイに発展させようって動機だったんだ。
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It was to motivate your desire to escape, and\n"
"kickstart your urge to kill."
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、残酷な事をするよね…
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "But still...what a cruel thing to do."
msgstr ""

#. よく言うよ…あんたがやったクセに！
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You're the one that did it!"
msgstr ""

#. うんうん、非難は甘んじて受け入れるつもりだよ。
msgctxt "0010 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Yes, well, I'm perfectly happy to accept your\n"
"disapproval."
msgstr ""

#. はぁーい！　じゃあ、次のクイズでーす！
msgctxt "0011 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Okaaay! Time for the next question!"
msgstr ""

#. えっとね、２番目の大和田クンの時なんだけど、
#. あの時の動機のテーマは、なんでしょーか！？
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Umm, so...what was the theme for the second motive!?"
msgstr ""

#. 思い出
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The past"
msgstr ""

#. 人生の意味
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The meaning of life"
msgstr ""

#. ポカーン…です。
msgctxt "0015 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I'm doing my very best to hide my irritation."
msgstr ""

#. 聞かなかった事にしてあげます。
msgctxt "0016 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I'm just gonna pretend like I didn't hear that..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>くっ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kh...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 強い心
msgctxt "0019 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "A strong heart"
msgstr ""

#. ブブーです！　ハズレです。
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Bzzt! Totally wrong!"
msgstr ""

#. あんまり的外れだと、
#. おしおきしてしまいますよ。
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Keep gettin' these wrong, and I'll have no choice but\n"
"to punish you!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大和田クンが不二咲クンを殺した理由…
#. そこには悲しい過去の出来事があったはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The reason Mondo killed Chihiro... There was a long\n"
"history of sadness surrounding the whole thing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>過去の出来事…それって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A long history...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ほらほら思い出してごらんよ！
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Come on, you gotta remember!"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲君が殺されたあの２番目の殺人をさ…！
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That second murder! The death of Chihiro!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時…
#. モノクマはボクらに妙な手紙を配って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That time, Monokuma gave us all those creepy\n"
"envelopes...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが受け取った手紙には
#. おねしょの事が書いてあって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In mine, it talked about how I used to wet the bed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>２番目の殺人の時…
#. あの時の動機のテーマ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For the second murder...the motive's theme was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>２番目の殺人の時…
#. あの時の動機のテーマ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For the second murder...the motive's theme was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時、ボク達はモノクマから
#. 妙な手紙を受け取ったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's when we got those weird envelopes from\n"
"Monokuma...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには…ボクのおねしょの秘密が書いてあって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mine mentioned how I used to wet the bed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、２番目の殺人の時、
#. ボクらに提示された動機のテーマって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So the theme that time was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
